---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Remove a template

Usage: bento template rm [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Template name or ID (prefix)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

  -f, --force
          Skip confirmation prompts

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: table, json or yaml

          [possible values: table, json, yaml]

      --json
          Output in JSON format

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
